---
import Default from '@astrojs/starlight/components/MarkdownContent.astro';
import BookLanding from './BookLanding.astro';
import { books, publicationCounts } from '../lib/books';
const volume = books.find((book) => Astro.url.pathname === book.href);
const isContents = Astro.url.pathname === '/read/';
---
{volume ? <div class="volume-content"><BookLanding id={volume.id} /></div> : isContents ? <Default>
  <p>{books.length} 册书，全书共 {publicationCounts.total} 章实战指南已全量完结上线（{publicationCounts.published} 章已发布）。建议从第一册开始，按自己的节奏阅读。</p>
  {books.map((book) => <section><h2 id={book.id}><a href={book.href}>第{['一','二','三','四'][book.number-1]}册：{book.title}</a></h2><ol class="chapter-list">{book.chapters.map((c) => <li>{c.published ? <a href={c.href!}><span class="chapter-number">{String(c.number).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>{c.title}</span><span class="chapter-state">阅读 ↗</span></a> : <div class="chapter-planned"><span class="chapter-number">{String(c.number).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span>{c.title}</span><span class="chapter-state">计划中</span></div>}</li>)}</ol></section>)}
  <p>通过顶部搜索查找正文内容。阅读记录仅保留在当前浏览器，不需要账户或数据库。</p>
</Default> : <Default><slot /></Default>}
